# Kang, Suspicious Captain: the goad forces an attack only "if able" (CR 701.15b), and a creature with defender is not
# able, so the Wall of Wood Kang goads on turn 3 stays home while Bot2 attacks with Ornithopter, which is not goaded. That
# attack is one attack event and the Wall carries a goaded effect, but the attacking creature does not: Kang's ability does
# not fire and no counter appears (CR 508.1, 603.2c) - a matcher keyed on goaded attackers alone, not on any goaded
# creature anywhere. In turn 4's second main phase Bot2 kills Kang with Terror, and the goad it gave lasts only as long as
# Bot1 controls Kang (CR 611.2b), so the Wall is no longer goaded on turn 5.

[Bot1 Deck]
Mox Ruby
Mox Jet
Mox Pearl
Mox Sapphire
Kang, Suspicious Captain
Mountain x2
Mountain x12

[Bot2 Deck]
Forest
Wall of Wood
Ornithopter
Swamp
Terror
Forest x2
Swamp x12

[Actions]
Bot1.Hand.Mox Ruby.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Jet.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Pearl.Cast
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Hand.Mox Sapphire.Cast
Bot1.Pass
[T2 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Forest.Play
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Wall of Wood.Cast
Bot2.Pass
Bot2.Hand.Ornithopter.Cast
Bot2.Pass
[T3 Bot1.Main1]
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Ruby.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Jet.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Pearl.Activate
Bot1.Battlefield.Mox Sapphire.Activate
Bot1.Hand.Kang, Suspicious Captain.Cast
? Bot1.Mana =
Bot1.Pass
Bot1.Target(Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Wood)
[T3 Bot1.DeclareAttackers]
? Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Wood.GoadedBy = Bot1
[T4 Bot2.Main1]
Bot2.Hand.Swamp.Play
[T4 Bot2.DeclareAttackers]
Bot2.Attack(Ornithopter > Bot1)
[T4 Bot2.Main2]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Kang, Suspicious Captain.Counters.PlusOnePlusOne = (absent)
Bot2.Battlefield.Swamp.Activate
Bot2.Battlefield.Forest.Activate
Bot2.Hand.Terror.Cast(Bot1.Battlefield.Kang, Suspicious Captain)
[T5 Bot1.Main1]
? Bot1.Battlefield.Kang, Suspicious Captain = (absent)
? Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Wood.GoadedBy = (absent)
? Bot1.Life = 20

[Expect]
Bot1.Life = 20
Bot1.Battlefield = Mox Ruby; Mox Jet; Mox Pearl; Mox Sapphire
Bot2.Battlefield.Wall of Wood.GoadedBy = (absent)
